map is ambiguous for this pipeline; write Array.map(...) or Option.map(...) or Result.map(...) or Chunk.map(...) or Effect.map(...) or Schedule.map(...) or Stream.map(...) or Record.map(...) or HashMap.map(...) or HashSet.map(...) or Config.map(...) or Cause.map(...) or Exit.map(...) (or lift nullable JS values with fromNullishOr(...) first)
